      {
        "id": 85479,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-30T03:19:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Before acquiring my Rook City / Infernal Relics box, I made proxies of those decks to practice with, and found these abbrevs helpful.</p><p>ASOVT - At start of villain turn.</p><p>AEOVT - At end of villain turn.</p><p>ASOET - At start of environment turn.</p><p>ASOYT - At start of your turn.</p><p>ASOHT - At start of a hero's turn</p><p>Etc.</p><p>+HP Hero = Hero target with the highest HP.</p><p>-HP Hero = Hero target witht he lowest HP.</p><p>Drop word \"damage\" whenever a damage type is stated (eg Ronway deals H-2 fire and H-2 infernal).</p><p>Generally, de-formalize the language anyplace you're certain it won't affect functionality.</p>",
